        "note": "Zero on the left is the identity: the result is exactly the right argument."
      },
      {
        "point": "right zero",
        "statement": "VTask.add b 0 = b for all b : Num",
        "note": "Zero on the right is also the identity: the result is exactly the left argument."
      },
